WEBVTT

01:30.860 --> 01:34.970
[Legend of the Magnate]

01:35.030 --> 01:38.009
[Episode 23]

01:38.509 --> 01:39.060
Earlier today, when you

01:39.060 --> 01:40.530
took me into the city,

01:40.950 --> 01:42.400
you never thought

01:42.430 --> 01:44.160
I'd make it back alive, did you?

01:51.509 --> 01:52.229
Mr. Gu,

01:53.229 --> 01:54.789
where is this coming from?

01:57.640 --> 01:59.500
What qualifications do I have

01:59.680 --> 02:01.810
to be the Pacification Commissioner?

02:03.310 --> 02:04.970
I offered Her Majesty the Empress Dowager

02:04.970 --> 02:06.430
some Orchid Snow tea,

02:07.400 --> 02:09.259
which offended the Sixth Prince.

02:10.150 --> 02:11.030
And yet he still wanted me

02:11.030 --> 02:13.160
to be the Pacification Commissioner?

02:13.520 --> 02:15.430
What sense does that make?

02:17.800 --> 02:18.590
Well...

02:19.590 --> 02:20.240
Mr. Gu,

02:20.800 --> 02:22.680
you've got that wrong.

02:23.590 --> 02:24.630
From what you're saying,

02:24.630 --> 02:25.960
since you already knew,

02:26.079 --> 02:27.400
why did you still go?

02:28.560 --> 02:29.120
Yes,

02:29.760 --> 02:30.560
I knew.

02:31.930 --> 02:34.090
Even knowing the risks, I had to go!

02:36.140 --> 02:37.120
I wanted to

02:37.150 --> 02:38.810
save whoever I could!

02:52.120 --> 02:53.250
I'm sorry, my Lords.

02:55.750 --> 02:57.950
Now that everything is settled here...

02:58.360 --> 03:00.420
I'll go back to my village to grow tea.

03:01.030 --> 03:02.140
From now on,

03:02.910 --> 03:03.920
I will never again

03:04.240 --> 03:05.900
try to outshine you, my Lords.

03:08.240 --> 03:10.520
This commoner didn't know any better

03:11.520 --> 03:12.800
and caused much offense.

03:12.800 --> 03:13.860
I'll drink this one

03:13.870 --> 03:14.730
as punishment.

03:27.430 --> 03:28.500
Mr. Gu, Mr. Gu,

03:28.560 --> 03:30.190
you've misunderstood!
You've misunderstood me!

03:30.190 --> 03:32.110
This is absolutely not the case!

03:32.150 --> 03:32.750
My Lord,

03:33.120 --> 03:35.320
you're an official, and I'm a commoner!

03:35.590 --> 03:37.400
How could there be any misunderstanding?

03:37.400 --> 03:38.590
-Come down first.
-Mr. Gu!

03:38.590 --> 03:39.610
Don't act rashly!

03:39.870 --> 03:41.210
His Highness didn't mean it that way!

03:41.210 --> 03:42.910
And you're not just a commoner!

03:42.910 --> 03:46.280
You're the Pacification Commissioner
appointed by the imperial court!

03:46.280 --> 03:48.079
You still hold the appointment!

03:48.310 --> 03:50.310
If you leave now, it will be seen as
defying the court—

03:50.310 --> 03:51.280
as inviting disaster!

03:51.280 --> 03:52.410
Inviting disaster?

03:52.540 --> 03:53.870
Come and arrest me then!

03:54.370 --> 03:54.750
Hyah!

03:54.840 --> 03:55.240
You...

03:58.710 --> 03:59.280
Well...

04:03.870 --> 04:04.800
Let him go.

04:05.400 --> 04:07.120
We'll just risk a few harsh words—

04:07.120 --> 04:08.430
just say we couldn't keep him here.

04:08.430 --> 04:11.150
A man like him is too stubborn
and too lucky.

04:11.610 --> 04:12.930
Once he learns

04:12.960 --> 04:13.560
our ways,

04:13.870 --> 04:15.530
we won't be able to rein him in.

04:17.360 --> 04:19.420
But what if the court asks about this?

04:21.240 --> 04:23.200
Tomorrow we attack Hefei.

04:23.560 --> 04:25.600
With such a great military achievement,

04:25.600 --> 04:26.830
even the Empress Dowager herself

04:26.830 --> 04:27.680
couldn't

04:27.720 --> 04:29.520
punish us arbitrarily for this.

04:32.630 --> 04:33.090
Come on.

04:33.190 --> 04:34.190
Back to drinking.

04:59.800 --> 05:00.400
My friend,

05:00.600 --> 05:01.510
missing home?

05:03.830 --> 05:08.010
[Safe]

05:59.190 --> 06:00.250
What's happening?

06:01.960 --> 06:03.140
The imperial court is going to kill us!

06:03.140 --> 06:05.630
Everyone, let's stick together
and rush out!

06:05.630 --> 06:06.740
Run quickly!

06:06.760 --> 06:07.300
Fire!

06:35.650 --> 06:39.830
[Safe]

06:51.950 --> 06:53.360
Congratulations, Governor Qiao.

06:53.360 --> 06:54.390
Without shedding a drop of blood,

06:54.390 --> 06:56.790
you've eliminated so many enemies at once!

06:56.920 --> 06:58.980
Good thing your friend isn't around.

06:59.150 --> 06:59.750
If he were,

07:00.040 --> 07:02.100
this wouldn't have gone so smoothly.

07:02.630 --> 07:03.760
It's heaven's will.

07:53.790 --> 07:54.380
Help...

07:55.830 --> 07:56.920
Help me...

08:45.670 --> 08:46.790
Mr. Gu, you're awake.

08:46.790 --> 08:48.270
Your qi and blood surged to your heart,

08:48.270 --> 08:49.200
causing damage to your internal organs.

08:49.200 --> 08:51.000
I've brewed some herbal medicine for you.

08:51.000 --> 08:51.610
Here...

08:53.150 --> 08:54.820
Killing those who surrender
brings misfortune.

08:54.820 --> 08:57.550
Killing those who surrender
brings misfortune!

09:02.000 --> 09:02.790
Misfortune?

09:04.320 --> 09:05.110
Gu,

09:05.320 --> 09:06.250
I'm not like you.

09:06.630 --> 09:07.960
I'm not that lucky.

09:08.550 --> 09:09.600
My position

09:09.670 --> 09:12.200
was earned through battle after battle!

09:12.960 --> 09:14.270
Because of this war,

09:14.390 --> 09:16.790
my brother and elderly mother are missing.

09:17.670 --> 09:19.600
Now, you tell me about misfortune?

09:20.150 --> 09:22.510
Then misfortune it is.

09:25.360 --> 09:27.240
We've already started attacking Hefei.

09:27.240 --> 09:28.670
By nightfall at the latest,

09:28.670 --> 09:29.930
Hefei will fall!

09:30.080 --> 09:31.240
This great military merit

09:31.240 --> 09:33.170
will be credited to all three of us!

09:38.440 --> 09:38.900
Attack!

09:39.510 --> 09:39.970
Attack!

09:43.790 --> 09:45.450
This will earn us great merit!

10:07.240 --> 10:07.790
Gu.

10:09.870 --> 10:11.670
If you really walk out this gate,

10:11.960 --> 10:12.750
then from now on,

10:12.750 --> 10:15.280
I'll have no choice
but to treat you as a rebel.

10:16.000 --> 10:18.460
Your mother and brother
are still out there.

10:19.960 --> 10:21.690
Is this really worth the price?

10:24.550 --> 10:25.280
Come with me.

10:43.550 --> 10:49.670
[Marshal]

10:46.920 --> 10:49.320
Her Majesty the Empress Dowager's decree.

11:29.320 --> 11:30.080
Gu.

11:35.510 --> 11:37.310
"Whether they surrender or not,

11:37.750 --> 11:39.350
execute them immediately."

11:40.240 --> 11:41.960
It's Her Majesty's order.

11:54.030 --> 11:56.130
Gu, don't act on impulse.

11:56.440 --> 11:57.840
Let me ask you something.

11:57.840 --> 11:59.120
Given the current situation,

11:59.120 --> 12:00.520
do you think they can win?

12:01.650 --> 12:03.320
Whether they surrender

12:03.360 --> 12:04.360
or die in battle,

12:04.390 --> 12:06.720
the imperial court will never spare them.

12:06.730 --> 12:07.690
You know it.

12:15.120 --> 12:17.270
My friend, I too am a scholar.

12:15.760 --> 12:22.170
[Marshal]

12:18.600 --> 12:19.750
I don't want to carry out this order

12:19.750 --> 12:21.360
to kill those who surrender.

12:22.270 --> 12:23.470
But I thought it over—

12:23.550 --> 12:26.030
if I don't do it, someone else will.

12:27.840 --> 12:28.970
A court like this...

12:31.150 --> 12:32.810
What's the point in saving it?

12:33.440 --> 12:34.390
Gu,

12:35.510 --> 12:36.840
about killing those who surrender,

12:36.840 --> 12:38.300
we can't be soft-hearted.

12:38.840 --> 12:40.150
The men Li Cheng commands

12:40.150 --> 12:41.480
are all veteran rebels!

12:41.720 --> 12:42.910
They've been fighting for 10 years!

12:42.910 --> 12:44.390
You expect them to suddenly obey the law

12:44.390 --> 12:45.510
and live as good citizens?

12:45.510 --> 12:46.510
Is that possible?

12:49.390 --> 12:51.150
In times like these,
if you want to be a good person,

12:51.150 --> 12:51.750
fine—

12:52.320 --> 12:53.450
go home and grow tea.

12:53.790 --> 12:54.200
Here's a chance to save

12:54.200 --> 12:56.010
400,000 civilian households,

12:56.080 --> 12:58.000
but you run off just to keep

12:58.030 --> 12:58.910
your reputation clean.

12:58.910 --> 13:00.970
Isn't that too selfish?

13:23.170 --> 13:24.200
[Desheng Gate]

13:25.140 --> 13:25.660
[Desheng Gate]

14:07.160 --> 14:08.000
[Desheng Gate]

14:14.670 --> 14:15.550
Your Highness!

14:23.840 --> 14:24.720
Li Cheng!

14:26.320 --> 14:27.120
Li Cheng!

14:27.510 --> 14:28.360
Li Cheng!

14:33.300 --> 14:34.090
How are you?

14:34.300 --> 14:35.240
Are you hurt?

14:35.270 --> 14:35.800
I'm fine.

14:38.350 --> 14:39.030
Dear,

14:39.910 --> 14:40.790
listen to me.

14:43.840 --> 14:46.630
I'm afraid we can't hold this place
until nightfall.

14:46.630 --> 14:47.440
In a moment,

14:48.120 --> 14:49.450
I'll send a cavalry unit

14:49.510 --> 14:51.110
to escort you out of the city.

14:51.680 --> 14:52.710
What did you say?

14:53.720 --> 14:55.180
Escort you out of the city.

14:56.000 --> 14:57.330
You want to send me away?

14:57.750 --> 14:59.150
Where am I supposed to go?

15:03.440 --> 15:04.360
Anywhere.

15:05.550 --> 15:06.480
Just stay alive.

15:08.650 --> 15:09.390
No.

15:11.310 --> 15:12.910
If we cannot share the same bed in life,

15:12.910 --> 15:15.040
we shall share the same grave in death.

15:15.360 --> 15:16.890
That's what you promised.

15:17.550 --> 15:18.910
Do you want me to go to a place

15:18.910 --> 15:20.300
where I know no one

15:20.510 --> 15:22.530
and beg for food until I die?

15:22.730 --> 15:23.920
I won't leave.

15:26.000 --> 15:27.460
The south gate has fallen!

15:28.050 --> 15:29.900
[Desheng Gate]

15:33.870 --> 15:34.510
No.

15:34.960 --> 15:35.860
No!

15:49.080 --> 15:49.750
No...

16:14.210 --> 16:15.540
[Peace and Abundance]

16:22.510 --> 16:24.910
By order of Pacification Commissioner Gu,

16:24.960 --> 16:26.170
all the uninjured

16:26.240 --> 16:27.390
shall form ranks,

16:27.510 --> 16:29.870
build detention quarters,
and remain imprisoned here,

16:29.870 --> 16:31.320
awaiting the imperial decree!

16:31.320 --> 16:33.080
Commanding General Li Cheng and his family

16:33.080 --> 16:34.640
will be placed elsewhere!

16:48.790 --> 16:49.720
These two are

16:49.750 --> 16:51.440
rebel leaders and will be sent
to the capital in chains!

16:51.440 --> 16:52.870
Keep a close eye on them!

16:53.000 --> 16:54.200
-Yes, sir!
-Yes, sir!

17:38.000 --> 17:39.410
He's dying!

17:41.410 --> 17:42.400
Are you going to send

17:42.400 --> 17:43.860
his corpse to the capital?

17:46.720 --> 17:47.920
The man is dying!

17:49.160 --> 17:50.290
Someone, help!

17:59.150 --> 18:00.710
Anyone, help!

18:04.550 --> 18:05.550
Help!

18:24.340 --> 18:25.030
This is the best trauma powder

18:25.030 --> 18:26.030
I could find.

18:26.910 --> 18:28.500
[Trauma Powder]

18:27.190 --> 18:28.050
Apply it to him.

18:29.080 --> 18:30.740
It will keep him alive for now.

18:31.110 --> 18:33.280
You want to throw me in a prison cart

18:34.200 --> 18:35.660
and take me to the capital,

18:36.920 --> 18:39.640
so the Emperor can watch my head fall

18:40.240 --> 18:42.570
to the ground at the Meridian Gate, right?

18:45.000 --> 18:46.240
Otherwise,

18:47.640 --> 18:49.270
the Emperor will get angry,

18:50.960 --> 18:53.490
and you'll all lose
your official positions.

18:59.960 --> 19:00.510
Li Cheng,

19:01.750 --> 19:03.680
you've greatly misunderstood me.

19:05.680 --> 19:07.240
Those soldiers who surrendered

19:07.240 --> 19:09.110
now lie buried beneath the city.

19:12.070 --> 19:13.790
They all believed your words

19:15.000 --> 19:16.270
and went out.

19:19.240 --> 19:21.170
Four hundred and sixty-one lives.

19:22.440 --> 19:23.570
I remember them all.

19:25.110 --> 19:26.510
If there's retribution,

19:26.720 --> 19:27.850
I won't hide from it.

19:30.400 --> 19:32.150
But I must keep the promise

19:32.640 --> 19:33.640
I made to Mr. Bai.

19:35.070 --> 19:35.790
Bai Yimei—

19:36.830 --> 19:38.360
I must ensure her safety.

19:40.270 --> 19:41.310
Enough, Gu.

19:42.880 --> 19:44.210
You're a high official.

19:44.550 --> 19:45.680
I'm just a commoner.

19:46.680 --> 19:48.240
You don't need to worry about my life.

19:48.240 --> 19:49.570
I'm not going anywhere.

19:51.000 --> 19:51.880
What I mean is,

19:53.510 --> 19:54.910
I want both of you to live.

19:58.110 --> 20:00.110
I'm the defending general of Anhui.

20:01.160 --> 20:02.030
Save me?

20:03.510 --> 20:05.970
How many heads do you think you have
to spare?

20:06.310 --> 20:07.830
Nanjing has fallen.

20:08.790 --> 20:09.680
On June 16th,

20:10.640 --> 20:12.040
the city walls collapsed

20:12.640 --> 20:13.970
and all nine gates fell.

20:14.790 --> 20:16.960
After ten days of burning, killing,
and looting,

20:16.960 --> 20:18.200
Nanjing is now a city

20:18.680 --> 20:19.940
of utter devastation—

20:20.070 --> 20:21.530
its tragedy beyond words.

20:22.510 --> 20:24.370
Time to wake up from your dreams of

20:24.920 --> 20:26.920
being Prince and Princess Consort.

20:28.200 --> 20:29.110
From now on,

20:30.510 --> 20:32.310
you need to live for yourselves.

20:33.590 --> 20:35.110
Even if the King of Hell

20:35.720 --> 20:37.320
wants to take your lives now,

20:38.750 --> 20:40.350
I'll do everything possible

20:40.510 --> 20:41.440
to pull you back.

20:42.550 --> 20:44.410
Just don't give up on yourselves.

20:45.880 --> 20:46.480
Take care.

20:57.690 --> 20:57.900
[Trauma Powder]

21:12.680 --> 21:14.830
Do you believe him?

21:22.070 --> 21:23.400
Go with him.

21:23.850 --> 21:24.440
What nonsense...

21:24.440 --> 21:26.900
Neither of us can escape
if you take me along.

21:27.830 --> 21:28.960
Go with him.

21:30.400 --> 21:31.930
If I wanted to go with him...

21:32.920 --> 21:34.850
why did I run out in the first place?

21:37.920 --> 21:39.720
If we die, we die together.

21:40.670 --> 21:41.510
Li,

21:42.020 --> 21:43.350
you can't decide for me!

21:43.640 --> 21:44.510
No one can!

21:44.720 --> 21:45.920
What about our child?

21:51.160 --> 21:53.350
Can our child decide for you?

22:01.390 --> 22:03.000
You're pregnant.

22:04.760 --> 22:06.400
Why didn't you tell me?

22:16.060 --> 22:17.260
Promise me...

22:19.920 --> 22:21.920
you'll keep this child alive.

22:24.420 --> 22:25.510
Through him,

22:26.710 --> 22:28.030
I live on.

22:32.310 --> 22:33.960
No. No, no.

22:35.910 --> 22:36.710
I'm not going.

22:37.350 --> 22:38.950
We'll all survive together.

22:39.260 --> 22:40.320
Rest well and heal.

22:41.200 --> 22:42.240
We'll all be fine.

22:42.260 --> 22:43.640
We'll all survive.

22:43.970 --> 22:45.290
Just like you said—

22:46.110 --> 22:47.160
the God in heaven

22:47.940 --> 22:49.040
will help us.

22:49.160 --> 22:50.240
Whatever we've done,

22:50.240 --> 22:51.430
He will forgive us.

22:59.670 --> 23:01.750
Don't waste your strength.

23:04.130 --> 23:05.790
Lie down beside me for a while.

23:19.800 --> 23:21.790
Are you going to leave me alone...

23:25.260 --> 23:26.750
in this world?

23:33.880 --> 23:34.510
Li Cheng!

23:48.890 --> 23:50.620
I heard you've been commended.

23:50.770 --> 23:53.370
I haven't had a chance
to congratulate you yet.

24:14.400 --> 24:15.260
Don't you think

24:15.270 --> 24:16.510
you owe me an explanation?

24:16.510 --> 24:17.790
What do I need to explain?

24:17.790 --> 24:18.750
I didn't kill

24:18.790 --> 24:19.460
those 400-plus surrendered soldiers.

24:19.460 --> 24:20.790
I knew nothing about it.

24:21.550 --> 24:22.790
If you don't believe me,

24:22.790 --> 24:23.590
go on, kill me.

24:23.830 --> 24:24.440
If I didn't believe you,

24:24.440 --> 24:26.770
do you think you would still be breathing?

24:28.960 --> 24:29.720
I tried to

24:30.400 --> 24:31.460
persuade Li Cheng.

24:32.550 --> 24:33.720
He's set on dying.

24:34.700 --> 24:35.830
I can't change his mind.

24:35.830 --> 24:37.640
Aren't you supposed to be the clever one?

24:37.640 --> 24:39.350
Don't you know how to persuade someone?

24:39.350 --> 24:42.080
Before becoming
Pacification Commissioner...

24:42.440 --> 24:43.680
I thought with my ability

24:43.680 --> 24:44.590
and wisdom,

24:45.350 --> 24:46.880
I could change things.

24:47.640 --> 24:48.830
But after taking this position,

24:48.830 --> 24:49.890
I realized that...

24:51.240 --> 24:52.900
all I can do is go with the flow.

24:54.160 --> 24:55.590
I can't change anything.

24:58.720 --> 24:59.980
The so-called history

25:01.030 --> 25:03.360
is merely an emperor's family genealogy.

25:04.160 --> 25:05.090
How ridiculous.

25:12.880 --> 25:14.610
So you've become enlightened.

25:15.200 --> 25:17.150
Are you planning to go back to growing tea

25:17.150 --> 25:18.400
or become a monk?

25:19.870 --> 25:21.200
I'm not going anywhere.

25:23.790 --> 25:24.720
Since I've already

25:24.720 --> 25:26.510
been dragged into this matter,

25:27.750 --> 25:29.310
I must Li Cheng and his wife's

25:29.310 --> 25:30.270
safety.

25:34.030 --> 25:35.200
I need your help.

25:43.720 --> 25:44.380
Go ahead.

25:45.160 --> 25:45.830
Recently,

25:47.110 --> 25:49.840
I've been reading
the imperial court bulletins.

25:50.640 --> 25:52.100
It's like doing business.

25:52.510 --> 25:54.510
I need to understand the situation.

25:54.960 --> 25:56.560
To those officials at court,

25:56.830 --> 25:57.890
Li Cheng and his men

25:58.110 --> 25:59.510
are like merchandise,

26:00.290 --> 26:02.550
waiting to be sold to the highest bidder.

26:02.550 --> 26:03.640
They can be handed over
to the Empress Dowager

26:03.640 --> 26:05.070
in exchange for an official position

26:05.070 --> 26:06.640
or recruited under one's own command

26:06.640 --> 26:07.900
to expand one's power.

26:08.070 --> 26:09.400
In these chaotic times,

26:10.160 --> 26:12.920
one might gain greater fame and fortune
with them.

26:12.920 --> 26:14.920
However, this batch of merchandise

26:15.110 --> 26:16.570
can't be kept for too long.

26:16.640 --> 26:17.270
They told me

26:17.270 --> 26:19.910
they wouldn't kill
innocent people indiscriminately.

26:19.910 --> 26:20.970
I don't trust them.

26:21.900 --> 26:23.030
That's why I stayed.

26:24.400 --> 26:25.500
You don't believe them?

26:25.500 --> 26:26.350
Of course not.

26:29.550 --> 26:30.960
Fame and profit—

26:31.920 --> 26:34.050
fame comes first, and profit follows.

26:34.950 --> 26:36.890
What nonsense about
"scholars having a conscience"?

26:36.890 --> 26:37.510
That's only because

26:37.510 --> 26:40.200
they haven't risen high enough
in officialdom yet.

26:40.200 --> 26:42.110
When it truly comes to trading lives

26:42.110 --> 26:43.790
for an official position,

26:44.720 --> 26:45.720
who would care about

26:45.720 --> 26:47.270
what they once said?

26:49.720 --> 26:50.920
For the people

26:51.550 --> 26:53.200
and the safety of Hefei,

26:54.270 --> 26:55.510
I need someone more powerful

26:55.510 --> 26:57.270
to help me.

27:00.390 --> 27:01.790
I've run out of leverage.

27:01.860 --> 27:03.520
I need someone with real clout

27:04.000 --> 27:05.160
to back me up.

27:09.830 --> 27:11.260
Who do you suggest?

27:11.880 --> 27:13.540
Have you heard of Marshal Jiu?

27:13.590 --> 27:14.790
The foremost marshal

27:14.790 --> 27:16.650
under the Viceroy of Liangjiang.

27:17.440 --> 27:18.610
From what I know,

27:19.070 --> 27:20.750
his military force is formidable,

27:20.750 --> 27:22.080
unmatched in the world.

27:22.110 --> 27:23.200
He is the person with real clout

27:23.200 --> 27:24.310
that I have in mind.

27:26.270 --> 27:29.160
I'm afraid even you wouldn't be able to

27:29.670 --> 27:31.550
approach such a heroic figure.

27:36.720 --> 27:38.520
You're trying to goad me into it.

27:41.000 --> 27:42.390
Jiu owes me a favor.

27:43.070 --> 27:44.330
He should feel honored

27:44.510 --> 27:46.110
that I even bother to see him.

27:52.350 --> 27:55.510
Report!

27:56.830 --> 27:57.650
Marshal Jiu

27:57.680 --> 28:00.010
from the Jiangning camp has sent a letter.

28:15.160 --> 28:16.310
Double the guard at noon.

28:16.310 --> 28:17.200
Go to the city and order

28:17.200 --> 28:18.310
the best Yan cuisine banquet!

28:18.310 --> 28:18.840
Yes, sir!

28:30.110 --> 28:32.510
Jiu is utterly arrogant and disrespectful!

28:32.510 --> 28:33.880
He's been besieging Jiangning
for three years

28:33.880 --> 28:35.160
without gaining an inch of land!

28:35.160 --> 28:36.030
Now he comes here

28:36.030 --> 28:37.440
to steal my credit!

28:37.550 --> 28:38.550
What should we do?

28:39.740 --> 28:41.830
I'll write a memorial to impeach him!

28:42.640 --> 28:45.530
I've only heard that the man carries
a murderous air.

28:45.530 --> 28:46.550
Throughout the Yangtze region,

28:46.550 --> 28:48.310
the army under his command

28:48.390 --> 28:49.590
is the most powerful.

28:50.000 --> 28:51.860
We must not offend him to his face.

28:52.440 --> 28:54.240
As for a memorial,

28:54.510 --> 28:56.310
the imperial court is
counting on his service.

28:56.310 --> 28:57.310
If you file a report,

28:57.310 --> 28:59.040
will the court side with him...

28:59.640 --> 29:00.310
or with you?

29:00.830 --> 29:02.030
Then what should I do?

29:02.830 --> 29:04.920
Those prisoners of war are elite soldiers.

29:04.920 --> 29:06.120
Hefei has been taken,

29:06.240 --> 29:07.880
and now he just writes a note

29:07.960 --> 29:09.160
saying he's going to come take

29:09.160 --> 29:09.750
those 1,000-plus prisoners

29:09.750 --> 29:11.100
to incorporate into his army.

29:11.100 --> 29:11.880
Isn't that...

29:11.880 --> 29:13.540
Isn't that outright robbery?

29:15.640 --> 29:17.590
Send Li Cheng and his wife to the capital

29:17.590 --> 29:19.510
in chains to present them to the court,

29:19.510 --> 29:21.510
and just give those prisoners
to Marshal Jiu.

29:21.510 --> 29:22.650
He should at least leave us

29:22.650 --> 29:24.270
some scraps, right?

29:25.030 --> 29:27.490
That's also how things work
in officialdom.

29:27.790 --> 29:28.260
Report!

29:28.440 --> 29:31.000
Marshal Jiu's advance troops have arrived
at the camp gate!

29:31.000 --> 29:32.030
Set up the ceremonial formation!

29:32.030 --> 29:33.030
All of you, look sharp!

29:33.030 --> 29:33.880
We'll wait outside the camp

29:33.880 --> 29:35.610
to welcome Marshal Jiu!

29:35.930 --> 29:36.460
Yes, sir!

29:54.790 --> 29:56.090
Where's our tea-selling

29:56.090 --> 29:57.750
Pacification Commissioner?

29:58.350 --> 29:59.550
This man, Gu Pingyuan,

29:59.550 --> 30:00.830
is neither truly a scholar

30:00.830 --> 30:02.030
nor truly a merchant.

30:02.510 --> 30:04.840
Why are you keeping such a close eye
on him?

30:05.880 --> 30:07.080
I fear his intentions

30:07.110 --> 30:09.030
are no longer aligned with ours.

30:09.590 --> 30:10.550
If we don't keep a close eye on him,

30:10.550 --> 30:11.880
there might be trouble.

30:13.560 --> 30:14.000
San!

30:16.950 --> 30:18.440
Go invite Lord Gu here immediately.

30:18.440 --> 30:19.680
Tell him Marshal Jiu has arrived.

30:19.680 --> 30:21.070
As the subordinates,
we're hosting a banquet,

30:21.070 --> 30:22.110
and he is obliged to attend.

30:22.110 --> 30:22.640
Yes, sir.

30:25.510 --> 30:26.110
He's here.

30:44.110 --> 30:45.710
What an impressive display!

30:46.440 --> 30:48.830
Jiu's carriage is quite novel.

30:49.000 --> 30:52.060
That's a foreign-style carriage,
like a turtle shell.

31:03.310 --> 31:04.970
-Welcome, Marshal Jiu!
-Welcome, Marshal Jiu!

31:04.970 --> 31:06.830
-Welcome, Marshal Jiu!
-Welcome, Marshal Jiu!

31:06.830 --> 31:09.490
-Welcome, Marshal Jiu!
-Welcome, Marshal Jiu!

31:11.060 --> 31:14.030
[Marshal of Jiangning, Marshal Jiu]

31:32.680 --> 31:33.330
Rise.

31:40.310 --> 31:42.110
I dare not trouble you with this.

31:46.510 --> 31:47.910
You two have worked hard.

31:50.240 --> 31:52.170
I heard about the victory at Hefei,

31:53.270 --> 31:56.160
and I haven't had the chance
to congratulate you yet.

31:56.160 --> 31:57.240
This small achievement

31:57.240 --> 31:58.640
can't compare to yours—

31:58.640 --> 32:00.400
years of bloody battles at Jiangning.

32:00.400 --> 32:02.360
It's hardly worth mentioning.

32:02.550 --> 32:03.410
Governor Qiao.

32:04.860 --> 32:05.590
Mr. Bao Qing.

32:10.110 --> 32:11.920
He's a descendant
of an old friend of mine.

32:11.920 --> 32:13.610
I just ran into him on the road—

32:13.790 --> 32:15.120
he kept me company.

32:15.620 --> 32:16.950
You all know each other?

32:17.140 --> 32:18.170
Of course.

32:18.610 --> 32:20.520
Mr. Gu is the Pacification Commissioner
personally appointed

32:20.520 --> 32:22.110
by Her Majesty the Empress Dowager.

32:22.110 --> 32:23.460
Amid the fierce battle,

32:23.550 --> 32:25.400
Mr. Gu has accomplished great merit.

32:25.400 --> 32:26.440
I was just looking for him

32:26.440 --> 32:28.840
but didn't expect to find him here
with you.

32:29.550 --> 32:31.270
Isn't it hot standing out here?

32:31.270 --> 32:32.640
After the meal, I'll take the men with me.

32:32.640 --> 32:33.500
Yes, of course.

32:33.510 --> 32:34.710
Please, Marshal Jiu.

32:36.640 --> 32:37.160
Mr. Gu,

32:37.430 --> 32:39.190
you actually know Marshal Jiu?

32:39.310 --> 32:41.440
We've known each other for a long time.

32:53.440 --> 32:54.550
There are only about 1,000

32:54.550 --> 32:56.150
prisoners of war from Hefei?

32:59.200 --> 33:00.460
What about the others?

33:01.510 --> 33:02.730
Where are the others?

33:04.640 --> 33:05.300
All killed?

33:06.400 --> 33:08.060
Buried to fertilize the soil?

33:08.070 --> 33:08.720
No.

33:09.030 --> 33:10.160
After such a long siege,

33:10.160 --> 33:11.880
some starved to death,
while others escaped.

33:11.880 --> 33:12.950
Those 1,000 or so

33:13.000 --> 33:14.640
are the ones
who fought to their last breath

33:14.640 --> 33:15.720
protecting their commander, Li Cheng.

33:15.720 --> 33:17.450
They're all severely wounded.

33:17.720 --> 33:19.510
Marshal Jiu, I'm afraid
you can't transport them now.

33:19.510 --> 33:20.960
It's better to leave them here.

33:20.960 --> 33:22.310
Once they've recovered,

33:22.310 --> 33:23.260
I'll tie them up

33:23.310 --> 33:24.720
and send them to your camp.

33:24.720 --> 33:25.750
Not long ago, I was
in the thick of battle,

33:25.750 --> 33:27.210
and my forces were strong!

33:27.640 --> 33:28.590
But damn it,

33:28.750 --> 33:31.240
a plague wiped out half my troops.

33:31.680 --> 33:34.090
I need to replenish my forces immediately!

33:38.160 --> 33:39.760
Those over 1,000 prisoners—

33:41.310 --> 33:44.110
as long as they're breathing,
I'm taking them all.

33:45.550 --> 33:46.280
Marshal Jiu,

33:46.310 --> 33:47.910
those 1,000-plus prisoners

33:48.030 --> 33:49.510
are indeed severely wounded.

33:49.510 --> 33:50.590
Let us

33:50.590 --> 33:51.990
reorganize them for you—

33:52.240 --> 33:53.410
shave their heads,

33:53.510 --> 33:55.350
feed them well,

33:55.510 --> 33:56.110
dress them warmly,

33:56.110 --> 33:57.310
restore their spirits,

33:57.310 --> 33:59.010
and then deliver them to you.

33:59.200 --> 34:00.600
Wouldn't that be better?

34:04.920 --> 34:07.180
Will you even be able to
send them by then?

34:08.800 --> 34:10.060
You think I don't know?

34:10.190 --> 34:10.960
You want to incorporate

34:10.960 --> 34:13.020
those captives into your own troops.

34:13.510 --> 34:14.360
Then later,

34:14.440 --> 34:16.510
you'll send me a bunch of old, weak, sick,
and disabled leftovers

34:16.510 --> 34:17.710
to fool me, is that it?

34:18.440 --> 34:20.670
Are you envious of my military success

34:21.280 --> 34:22.520
and want a share?

34:26.070 --> 34:26.670
Please.

34:29.070 --> 34:29.710
Marshal Jiu,

34:29.710 --> 34:31.030
I wouldn't dare, wouldn't dare.

34:31.030 --> 34:32.989
If you want them, just take them.

34:33.190 --> 34:34.120
How would we dare

34:34.510 --> 34:36.239
compete with you, Marshal Jiu?

34:37.150 --> 34:38.250
I want Li Cheng too.

34:40.030 --> 34:40.920
He's being held in prison.

34:40.920 --> 34:43.870
We're preparing to send him to the capital
in chains immediately.

34:43.870 --> 34:45.870
But we can't give this person to you.

34:46.000 --> 34:47.290
We've worked so hard for so long.

34:47.290 --> 34:48.400
Otherwise, we'd have no credit

34:48.400 --> 34:49.330
for our efforts.

34:53.810 --> 34:56.290
For a tiny little Hefei,

34:57.550 --> 34:58.880
you besieged it for so long,

34:58.880 --> 35:00.340
asked for so much money...

35:02.440 --> 35:04.100
and now you still want credit?

35:05.550 --> 35:06.320
Marshal Jiu.

35:07.880 --> 35:08.480
He's

35:08.510 --> 35:10.550
the only valuable piece we have left.

35:10.550 --> 35:12.030
You wave your hand

35:12.060 --> 35:13.440
and take all those prisoners—fine.

35:13.440 --> 35:14.400
At least leave us

35:14.440 --> 35:16.710
something to earn a promotion with!

35:16.760 --> 35:18.280
You've got a death wish?

35:20.280 --> 35:21.170
No, no, no.

35:21.360 --> 35:23.030
Why are you shouting at Marshal Jiu
like this?

35:23.030 --> 35:23.440
You...

35:25.070 --> 35:26.270
You're going too far!

35:26.280 --> 35:26.710
Bao...

35:29.710 --> 35:31.310
What disgraceful behavior!

35:32.030 --> 35:32.510
Well...

35:33.320 --> 35:34.280
This is outrageous.

35:34.280 --> 35:35.540
What's this all about?

35:36.280 --> 35:37.030
I told him.

35:38.840 --> 35:41.240
Apart from those 1,000-plus prisoners...

35:43.590 --> 35:44.400
I want Li Cheng

35:45.400 --> 35:46.150
as well.

35:47.280 --> 35:48.000
That's...

35:49.250 --> 35:51.190
Well... T-That really won't do.

35:51.270 --> 35:51.960
Won't do?

35:53.820 --> 35:54.440
Won't do.

35:55.510 --> 35:56.300
Won't do?

35:57.880 --> 35:58.360
Well...

35:58.510 --> 36:00.410
You want this, you want that!

36:00.440 --> 36:02.590
You should at least leave us something!

36:02.590 --> 36:03.920
You dare to fight me over a prisoner?

36:03.920 --> 36:04.880
You... keep...

36:15.150 --> 36:16.610
You need to keep your word.

36:17.630 --> 36:19.030
I avenged you.

36:19.880 --> 36:21.030
So you're just taking them by force?

36:21.030 --> 36:22.590
I'm not a businessman.

36:23.510 --> 36:25.640
I'm here precisely to take what I want.

36:26.000 --> 36:27.450
But you'll have to

36:27.710 --> 36:28.760
repay this favor.

37:05.030 --> 37:06.360
He's not dead yet, is he?

37:06.370 --> 37:07.100
Marshal Jiu!

37:07.840 --> 37:09.300
Marshal Jiu, Marshal Jiu.

37:10.230 --> 37:11.150
Get them out for me.

37:11.150 --> 37:12.410
I'll take both of them.

37:13.960 --> 37:14.690
Marshal Jiu,

37:15.150 --> 37:16.330
these two are supposed to be

37:16.330 --> 37:17.760
sent to the capital in shackles.

37:17.760 --> 37:18.960
If you take them both,

37:19.000 --> 37:20.800
how can we explain it
to the Empress Dowager

37:20.800 --> 37:21.920
and the Emperor? Please...

37:21.920 --> 37:23.120
at least leave us one.

37:23.150 --> 37:24.440
Yes, yes.

37:26.550 --> 37:28.710
Even crickets are kept in pairs.

37:30.070 --> 37:31.470
One alone won't survive.

37:32.280 --> 37:33.110
Take them both.

37:33.110 --> 37:33.710
Let's go!

38:01.130 --> 38:03.360
Gu, you invited Marshal Jiu here?

38:05.830 --> 38:06.890
Ms. Su invited him.

38:08.090 --> 38:09.320
Jiu is notorious for

38:09.340 --> 38:11.870
being merciless
and leaving nothing behind.

38:11.910 --> 38:13.800
I originally thought I'd face him

38:13.840 --> 38:15.310
on the battlefield—

38:15.590 --> 38:16.920
never thought I'd end up

38:16.920 --> 38:18.180
at his mercy like this.

38:18.960 --> 38:20.630
He's the Qing court's general.

38:20.630 --> 38:22.280
How could he possibly save us?

38:22.280 --> 38:23.540
Don't be fooled by him.

38:24.920 --> 38:26.720
The price must've been high, hm?

38:29.030 --> 38:30.490
Indeed, the price is high.

38:31.190 --> 38:33.230
But Gu, the money you spent

38:33.340 --> 38:34.400
might only be enough to save

38:34.400 --> 38:36.230
my wife and me.

38:38.030 --> 38:39.440
If you want all my men

38:39.460 --> 38:40.590
to live as well,

38:41.030 --> 38:43.030
how should you negotiate this deal?

38:50.920 --> 38:52.250
Please show some mercy.

38:53.180 --> 38:54.770
Give my men a chance to live.

38:56.230 --> 38:57.110
Mercy?

39:21.550 --> 39:23.010
Marshal Jiu means that...

39:24.550 --> 39:26.080
your men can be released...

39:27.280 --> 39:28.390
but you two

39:28.960 --> 39:30.160
must join his troops.

39:31.760 --> 39:33.000
And he wants you to serve under him

39:33.000 --> 39:34.150
as a military adviser.

39:34.150 --> 39:35.280
That way, he can justify himself

39:35.280 --> 39:36.320
to his subordinates

39:36.320 --> 39:37.780
and to the imperial court.

39:37.880 --> 39:39.390
After the war is over,

39:39.550 --> 39:40.950
he'll send you back home.

39:41.190 --> 39:43.330
Gu, you've risked your life

39:43.400 --> 39:44.800
and braved danger for us.

39:45.990 --> 39:48.120
I won't make things difficult for you.

39:48.590 --> 39:49.790
Bring me the clothes.

39:50.440 --> 39:51.570
I accept your offer.

39:55.840 --> 39:56.320
Stop!

40:04.960 --> 40:06.230
I, Zha Lanchai, Vice Commander

40:06.230 --> 40:07.590
of the Tiger Battalion
under Marshal Jiu's command,

40:07.590 --> 40:10.120
am here to attend to you
while you change, Sir!

40:27.270 --> 40:28.960
This bandit chief Li

40:29.320 --> 40:30.920
is truly skilled in battle.

40:32.030 --> 40:33.490
I really don't understand

40:33.890 --> 40:35.880
how an illiterate child,

40:35.900 --> 40:37.590
a filthy mine laborer,

40:38.360 --> 40:39.960
could have risen so far.

40:42.510 --> 40:43.320
What a pity.

40:45.150 --> 40:47.210
We couldn't meet on the battlefield.

40:50.080 --> 40:51.940
The Qing Empire's fate is sealed.

40:52.400 --> 40:55.150
Foolish rulers and incompetent ministers
maintain the status quo,

40:55.150 --> 40:57.560
flattering those above
and oppressing those below,

40:57.560 --> 40:59.490
yet remain blind to their own doom.

41:01.070 --> 41:03.470
The military campaign in Jiangnan is over.

41:03.670 --> 41:05.070
Spring has arrived,

41:05.320 --> 41:07.710
and the Central Plains are
ripe for conquest.

41:07.710 --> 41:08.440
Marshal Jiu.

41:09.840 --> 41:13.000
Are you interested in
claiming the Central Plains?

41:25.140 --> 41:28.110
[Delusion]

41:31.470 --> 41:32.060
[Delusion]

41:34.280 --> 41:35.800
This is a fine blade
Marshal Jiu had forged

41:35.800 --> 41:37.000
by master craftsmen.

41:37.000 --> 41:38.400
Only officers who achieve great merit

41:38.400 --> 41:39.190
are rewarded with one.

41:39.190 --> 41:40.920
General, now that you've turned to
the righteous side,

41:40.920 --> 41:42.780
your future is certainly bright!

42:32.000 --> 42:33.130
All of you, sit down!

42:47.090 --> 42:48.060
I know.

42:49.070 --> 42:50.370
Wearing these robes

42:51.840 --> 42:53.770
betrays our men who died in battle.

42:54.800 --> 42:56.260
But if I don't wear them...

42:57.850 --> 43:00.580
I betray the friend who risked his life
to save me.
